{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/10/11/0662329/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日、10月11日は19thシングル"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『いつかできるから今日できる』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売日です〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特典映像はあさひなぐプロジェクトのこと。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうぞよろしくお願いします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/10/11/0662329/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先日はじめての新潟公演で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の地方ツアーは終了しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一ヶ月空いたけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶり動けてよかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お米が美味しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/10/11/0662329/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"残すは東京ドーム！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今月発売のMdN、MmC対談のお相手は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映像監督の柳沢翔さんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"偉大なる初代監督。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"忙しい中合間を縫って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"話をしてくださいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この対談後にショートフィルムの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"打ち合わせをしたりしてました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『トイ』かなり刺激的。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"完成した作品を制作チームと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギャラリーで一緒に鑑賞して"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく幸せな空間だねって言ってくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"胸がいっぱいでした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなに見てほしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は次号の取材の日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあ誰でしょう！お楽しみに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/10/11/0662329/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5日から渋谷GALLERY X BY PARCOで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛開催中の個展"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"《伊藤万理華の脳内博覧会》"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後半戦突入しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"グッズが想定外の売れ行きみたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私もびっくりしてます。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現場で手に入らなかったみなさん、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個展に行けないみなさんにも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうにか手に渡ってほしいと考えています！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暫しお待ちを、、！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新潟ライブでメイクさんと衣装さんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"トートバッグとＴシャツを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普通に使ってくれたよーーーー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"普段から一緒に活動してて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お世話になっている方に見てもらえるのって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいよなあ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーも来てくれて嬉しいいかった"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私物展示してるから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心なしか部屋がすっきりしてて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それもそれでいいんだけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり集めたコレクションを"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"定期的に眺めないと落ち着かない、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち着かない日々、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"http://instagram.com/nounaihakurankai"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑個展関連の写真とかもろもろ更新してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2017/10/11/0662329/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}